    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "7zzcbey",
      "content": "Goa is the 25th State of India, formed on May 30, 1987 under the Goa, Daman and Diu Reorganisation Act, 1987. Prior to statehood, it was a Union Territory administered jointly with Daman and Diu."
