    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ns4nur8",
      "content": "The Goa SI (Sub-Inspector) exam is conducted by the Goa Police Department. SI is a Group B Gazetted post. Key aspects:"
    },
    {
      "id": "koq44ic",
      "type": "list",
      "items": [
        "Eligibility: Graduate with minimum age 18 years and maximum 30 years (relaxations applicable)",
        "Selection Process: Written Exam + Physical Efficiency Test (PET) + Medical Test + Interview",
        "Written Exam covers: General Knowledge (Goa-specific), Reasoning, Mathematics, English, and Marathi/Konkani"
      ]
    }
